{
  "summary": "This synthetic Commissioner's Bulletin amends the Texas Statistical Plan for Residential Risks by narrowing Cause of Loss code 25 to non-named-storm wind losses and adding Cause of Loss code 26 for named storm wind losses. It adds three conditional Loss Record Layout fields for code 26 records in positions 161\u2013181, effective for accident dates on or after October 1, 2026, with no required backfill for earlier 2026 submissions. The bulletin states that other named layouts, transmittal totals, and the NAIC MCAS reconciliation requirement are unchanged.",
